  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoonchoka kw’abaanto gotari ogw’ekeene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto nigo bagoteebania: “Inchuo, tomoiranere Omonene! Ekiagera nere ototaboranire, naende nere oratogwenie; nere otoakire chingoma, nere oratoboe chingoma chiaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’amatuko abere natokore tobe abayia. Ase rituko ria gatato natotenenie, na intwe ntogenderere koba moyo ase obosio bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe tiga tomomanye Omonene, ee, tiga tokore omokia tomomanye. Okooroka kwaye nigo korabe ogw’ekeene buna ogosoka kw’erioba; natochere buna embura, ee, buna embura ekwamia endagera na konyiyia riroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe Abaefraimu, ngento ki ndabakorere? Inwe Abayuda, ngento ki ndabakorere? Obwanchani bwaino nigo bonga buna ritaturi, na buna riime ria mambia rigosira bwango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio nabaakire goetera ase ababani baane, nabaitire namang’ana akorwa ase omonwa one; ebiina biane nkobanachera nigo bikooroka buna omobaso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo nkogokigwa nobwanchani kobua kogokigwa nebing’wanso; nigo nkogokigwa ng’a imomanye inche Nyasae kobua kogokigwa nebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto aba basaririe okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania, buna Adamu agosaretie. Ase amang’ana ayio babeire abatari abegenwa ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omochie o Gileadi nigo oichire nabaanto abakori amabe, chimbaratero chiabo nigo chiichire amanyinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani nigo banga buna ekeombe ki’abauri keboerete abanto, nigo bagoitera abanto ase enchera ekogenda Sekemu. Ee, nigo bagokora ayare amabe mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narorire ase Abaisraeli egento ekebe gi’okogechia; agwo nao Abaefraimu bagokorera obonyaka, ee, Abaisraeli besoirie ase ogotacheneka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nainwe Abayuda boigo, mwarikeirwe engaki ye rigesa ri’ogokora kwaino, ekero ndasibore abooswa b’abaanto baane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
